      "rationale": "Adds an unproved characterization of the definedness of K's partial Val-to-Int cast; Stage 1 imports this simplification while proving its claims and never proves the exact rule in a module that omits it.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-0312858a8718cb93d212cdb7b679a2875534dc14191dff8edf7bccf9a96d8b43",
      "start_line": 24,
      "text": "  rule #Ceil({@V:Val}:>Int)\n    => ({ definedProjectInt(@V) #Equals true } #And #Ceil(@V))\n    [simplification]"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [
        "simplification"
      ],
