      "rationale": "Adds a simplification bridge from dynamically sorted unary negation to projected Int subtraction; its exact statement is not separately proved before the rule is imported.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-dd0c5a6695115ef6c4608553ba13c7b4e2cd91e78ce50bf59e458ba0a5eb5be2",
      "start_line": 45,
      "text": "  rule applyUn(\"-\", V:Val)\n    => 0 -Int projectIntTotal(V)\n    requires isInt(V)\n    [simplification]"
    },
