      "normalized_sha256": "96422d110466a9240b0e25343046e54b8fa06a0bdf0abc4c25fcd195583f54da",
      "rationale": "Adds an unproved guarded simplification for the existing str builtin on a dynamic Val and connects its observable result to decimalCodes; Stage 1 contains no prior exact connection proof without this rule.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-96422d110466a9240b0e25343046e54b8fa06a0bdf0abc4c25fcd195583f54da",
      "start_line": 63,
      "text": "  rule applyBuiltin(\"str\", V:Val, .Vals)\n    => str(decimalCodes(projectIntTotal(V)))\n    requires isInt(V)\n     andBool projectIntTotal(V) >=Int 0\n    [simplification]"
